# survey folders in git (12 Nov 2026): every survey folder stays local, except the six
# original worked examples and the two Vulcan surveys; inside those, only the declaration
# files survey.yaml, filters.yaml, reference_edis.yaml and qc_notes.md are tracked, as in
# curnamona_cube. Notes folders are local in every survey. A file already tracked stays
# tracked until it is removed from git.
surveys/*
